---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" activePage="about">
  <header class="page-header">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="page-header-content">
        <div class="page-accent-marks" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="m3"></span>
          <span class="m1"></span>
          <span class="m2"></span>
        </div>
        <h1>About <span class="title-ckt"><span class="c">C</span><span class="k">K</span><span class="t">T</span></span></h1>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="prose wrap">
    <p>
      Made by CKT Ltd is a small app studio based in Shropshire, in the UK.
      We design, build, and maintain apps — some for pleasure, some for
      business — and we tend to go looking for niches that are underserved
      rather than crowded markets that already have ten big players in them.
    </p>

    <p>
      The studio was founded by <strong>Katie Mayers</strong> and
      <strong>Chris Hill</strong>. Between them they cover the design and
      engineering side of the studio, which means every app we work on gets
      looked at from both directions before it ships: does it look and feel
      right, and does it actually work properly under the hood.
    </p>

    <p class="pull">
      We'd rather build one app that fits its audience precisely than five
      that fit no one in particular.
    </p>

    <p>
      Right now that means <strong>Bike AI</strong>, our first app under
      active development — a motorcycle ride companion that uses on-device
      AI to help riders plan routes, log their journeys, and make sense of
      the details that matter while out on the road. It is being built for
      riders rather than adapted from a generic ride tracker, and we'll share
      more as it nears release.
    </p>

    <p>
      Made by CKT Ltd is registered in England &amp; Wales, company number
      17451719. If you want to talk to us about a project, a partnership, or
      anything else, the <a href="/support">support page</a> has our contact
      details.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
